### Triggering the flow
When you start this flow (manually or via API), pass these fields in the trigger payload:
```json
{
  "employeeName": "Jane Smith",
  "expenseDate": "2026-07-24",
  "totalAmount": 245.50,
  "category": "Travel",
  "description": "Flight to NYC for client meeting"
}
```

The manager will receive an Action Center task (and/or email) with all fields displayed, fill in optional comments, then click **Approve** or **Reject**.

